        "@value": "2-trans-4-cis-decadienoyl-CoA [mitochondrial matrix] + H+ [mitochondrial matrix] + NADH [mitochondrial matrix] => 3-trans-decenoyl-CoA [mitochondrial matrix] + NAD+ [mitochondrial matrix]"
