ol]\", \"inDisease\": false, \"maxDepth\": 1, \"name\": [\"H2O\", \"water\"], \"referenceType\": \"ReferenceMolecule\", \"schemaClass\": \"SimpleEntity\", \"stId\": \"R-ALL-29356\", \"stIdVersion\": \"R-ALL-29356.5\"}], \"isInDisease\": false, \"isInferred\": true, \"maxDepth\": 1, \"name\": [\"HMGCS1 condenses Ac-CoA and ACA-CoA to form bHMG-CoA\", \"acetoacetyl-CoA + acetyl-CoA + H2O => (3S)-3-hydroxy-3-methylglutaryl-CoA + CoA + H(+)\"], \"output\": [{\"className\": \"Chemical Compound\", \"dbId\": 76194, \"displayName\": \"CoA-SH [cytosol]\", \"inDisease\": false, \"maxDepth\": 1, \"name\": [\"CoA-SH\", \"coenzyme A(4-)\", \"coenzyme A\"], \"producedByEvent\": [10127704], \"referenceType\": \"ReferenceMolecule\", \"schemaClass\": \"SimpleEntity\", \"stId\": \"R-ALL-76194\", \"stIdVersion\": \"R-ALL-76194.5\"}, {\"className\": \"Chemical Compound\", \"dbId\": 191374, \"displayName\": \"bHMG-CoA [cytosol]\", \"inDisease\": false, \"maxDepth\": 1, \"name\": [\"bHMG-CoA\", \"(3S)-3-hydroxy-3-methylglutaryl-CoA(5-)\", \"beta-hydroxy-beta-methylglutaryl-CoA\", \"(3S)-3-hydroxy-3-methylglutaryl-CoA\", \"3-hydroxy-3-methylglutaryl-CoA\", \"HMG-CoA\", \"HMG-C0A(5-)\"], \"producedByEvent\": [10127704], \"referenceType\": \"ReferenceMolecule\", \"schemaClass\": \"SimpleEntity\", \"stId\": \"R-ALL-191374\", \"stIdVersion\": \"R-ALL-191374.5\"}, {\"className\": \"Chemical Compound\", \"dbId\": 70106, \"displayName\": \"H+ [cytosol]\", \"inDisease\": false, \"maxDepth\": 1, \"name\": [\"H+\", \"hydron\", \"proton\"], \"producedByEvent\": [10127704], \"referenceType\": \"ReferenceMolecule\", \"schemaClass\": \"SimpleEntity\", \"stId\": \"R-ALL-70106\", \"stIdVersion\": \"R-ALL-70106.5\"}], \"precedingEvent\": [{\"category\": \"transition\", \"className\": \"Reaction\", \"dbId\": 10203454, \"displayName\": \"ACAT2 condenses 2 Ac-CoA to form ACA-CoA\", \"followingEvent\": [10127704], \"isInDisease\": false, \"isInferred\": true, \"maxDepth\": 1, \"name\": [\"ACAT2 condenses 2 Ac-CoA to form ACA-CoA\", \"2 acetyl-CoA => acetoacetyl-CoA + CoA\"], \"releaseDate\": \"2026-06-17\", \"schemaClass\": \"Reaction\", \"speciesName\": \"Rattus norvegicus\", \"stId\": \"R-RNO-8848215\", \"stIdVersion\": \"R-RNO-8848215.1\"}], \"releaseDate\": \"2026-06-17\", \"schemaClass\": \"Reaction\", \"species\": [{\"abbreviation\": \"RNO\", \"className\": \"Species\", \"dbId\": 48895, \"displayName\": \"Rattus norvegicus\", \"name\": [\"Rattus norvegicus\", \"R. norvegicus\", \"Rn\", \"brown rat\", \"Norway rat\"], \"schemaClass\": \"Species\", \"taxId\": \"10116\"}], \"speciesName\": \"Rattus norvegicus\", \"stId\": \"R-RNO-191323\", \"stIdVersion\": \"R-RNO-191323.1\", \"summation\": [{\"className\": \"Summation\", \"dbId\": 9990864, \"displayName\": \"This event has been computationally inferred from an event that has been demonstrated in another species.<p>The inference is based on the homology mapping from PANTHER. Briefly, reactions for which all involved PhysicalEntities (in input, output and catalyst) have a mapped orthologue/paralogue (for complexes at least 75% of components must have a mapping) are inferred to the other species. High level events are also inferred for these events to allow for easier navigation.<p><a href='/electronic_inference_compara.html' target = 'NEW'>More details and caveats of the event inference in Reactome.</a> For details on PANTHER see also: <a href='http://www.pantherdb.org/about.jsp' target='NEW'>http://www.pantherdb.org/about.jsp</a>\", \"schemaClass\": \"Summation\", \"text\": \"This event has been computationally inferred from an event that has been demonstrated in another species.<p>The inference is based on the homology mapping from PANTHER. Briefly, reactions for which all involved PhysicalEntities (in input, output and catalyst) have a mapped orthologue/paralogue (for complexes at least 75% of components must have a mapping) are inferred to the other species. High level events are also inferred for these events to 