 192148, \"displayName\": \"25OH-CHOL [cytosol]\", \"inDisease\": false, \"maxDepth\": 1, \"name\": [\"25OH-CHOL\", \"25-hydroxycholesterol\"], \"producedByEvent\": [10127992], \"referenceType\": \"ReferenceMolecule\", \"schemaClass\": \"SimpleEntity\", \"stId\": \"R-ALL-192148\", \"stIdVersion\": \"R-ALL-192148.3\"}], \"releaseDate\": \"2026-06-17\", \"schemaClass\": \"Reaction\", \"species\": [{\"abbreviation\": \"RNO\", \"className\": \"Species\", \"dbId\": 48895, \"displayName\": \"Rattus norvegicus\", \"name\": [\"Rattus norvegicus\", \"R. norvegicus\", \"Rn\", \"brown rat\", \"Norway rat\"], \"schemaClass\": \"Species\", \"taxId\": \"10116\"}], \"speciesName\": \"Rattus norvegicus\", \"stId\": \"R-RNO-191983\", \"stIdVersion\": \"R-RNO-191983.1\", \"summation\": [{\"className\": \"Summation\", \"dbId\": 9990864, \"displayName\": \"This event has been computationally inferred from an event that has been demonstrated in another species.<p>The inference is based on the homology mapping from PANTHER. Briefly, reactions for which all involved PhysicalEntities (in input, output and catalyst) have a mapped orthologue/paralogue (for complexes at least 75% of components must have a mapping) are inferred to the other species. High level events are also inferred for these events to allow for easier navigation.<p><a href='/electronic_inference_compara.html' target = 'NEW'>More details and caveats of the event inference in Reactome.</a> For details on PANTHER see also: <a href='http://www.pantherdb.org/about.jsp' target='NEW'>http://www.pantherdb.org/about.jsp</a>\", \"schemaClass\": \"Summation\", \"text\": \"This event has been computationally inferred from an event that has been demonstrated in another species.<p>The inference is based on the homology mapping from PANTHER. Briefly, reactions for which all involved PhysicalEntities (in input, output and catalyst) have a mapped orthologue/paralogue (for complexes at least 75% of components must have a mapping) are inferred to the other species. High level events are also inferred for these events to allow for easier navigation.<p><a href='/electronic_inference_compara.html' target = 'NEW'>More details and caveats of the event inference in Reactome.</a> For details on PANTHER see also: <a href='http://www.pantherdb.org/about.jsp' target='NEW'>http://www.pantherdb.org/about.jsp</a>\"}]}"
