        "@value": "O2 [endoplasmic reticulum lumen] + NADH [endoplasmic reticulum lumen] + ALA-CoA [endoplasmic reticulum lumen] => H2O [endoplasmic reticulum lumen] + SDA-CoA [endoplasmic reticulum lumen] + NAD+ [endoplasmic reticulum lumen]"
