yl LPI is acylated to PI by MBOAT7\"], \"releaseDate\": \"2026-06-17\", \"schemaClass\": \"Reaction\", \"speciesName\": \"Rattus norvegicus\", \"stId\": \"R-RNO-1482598\", \"stIdVersion\": \"R-RNO-1482598.1\"}, {\"category\": \"transition\", \"className\": \"Reaction\", \"dbId\": 10161485, \"displayName\": \"2-acyl LPI is acylated to PI by MBOAT7\", \"followingEvent\": [10163816], \"isInDisease\": false, \"isInferred\": true, \"maxDepth\": 1, \"name\": [\"2-acyl LPI is acylated to PI by MBOAT7\"], \"releaseDate\": \"2026-06-17\", \"schemaClass\": \"Reaction\", \"speciesName\": \"Rattus norvegicus\", \"stId\": \"R-RNO-1482626\", \"stIdVersion\": \"R-RNO-1482626.1\"}, {\"category\": \"transition\", \"className\": \"Reaction\", \"dbId\": 10161736, \"displayName\": \"CDP-DAG is converted to PI by CDIPT\", \"followingEvent\": [10163816], \"isInDisease\": false, \"isInferred\": true, \"maxDepth\": 1, \"name\": [\"CDP-DAG is converted to PI by CDIPT\"], \"releaseDate\": \"2026-06-17\", \"schemaClass\": \"Reaction\", \"speciesName\": \"Rattus norvegicus\", \"stId\": \"R-RNO-1482976\", \"stIdVersion\": \"R-RNO-1482976.1\"}], \"releaseDate\": \"2026-06-17\", \"schemaClass\": \"Reaction\", \"species\": [{\"abbreviation\": \"RNO\", \"className\": \"Species\", \"dbId\": 48895, \"displayName\": \"Rattus norvegicus\", \"name\": [\"Rattus norvegicus\", \"R. norvegicus\", \"Rn\", \"brown rat\", \"Norway rat\"], \"schemaClass\": \"Species\", \"taxId\": \"10116\"}], \"speciesName\": \"Rattus norvegicus\", \"stId\": \"R-RNO-1675813\", \"stIdVersion\": \"R-RNO-1675813.1\", \"summation\": [{\"className\": \"Summation\", \"dbId\": 9990864, \"displayName\": \"This event has been computationally inferred from an event that has been demonstrated in another species.<p>The inference is based on the homology mapping from PANTHER. Briefly, reactions for which all involved PhysicalEntities (in input, output and catalyst) have a mapped orthologue/paralogue (for complexes at least 75% of components