        "@value": "H+ [peroxisomal matrix] + 2E-phytenoyl-CoA [peroxisomal matrix] + NADPH [peroxisomal matrix] => NADP+ [peroxisomal matrix] + Phytanoyl-CoA [peroxisomal matrix]"
