      {
        "@value": "O2 [endoplasmic reticulum lumen] + H+ [endoplasmic reticulum lumen] + NADPH [endoplasmic reticulum lumen] + AA [endoplasmic reticulum lumen] => NADP+ [endoplasmic reticulum lumen] + H2O [endoplasmic reticulum lumen] + 18-HETE [endoplasmic reticulum lumen]"
