        "@value": "NADPH [mitochondrial matrix] + H+ [mitochondrial matrix] + O2 [mitochondrial matrix] + 5bCHOL3a,7a,12a-triol [mitochondrial matrix] => NADP+ [mitochondrial matrix] + 5bCHOL3a,7a,12a,27-tetrol [mitochondrial matrix] + H2O [mitochondrial matrix]"
