        "@value": "NAD+ [cytosol] + CHOL7a,24(S)DIOL [endoplasmic reticulum membrane] => H+ [cytosol] + NADH [cytosol] + 4CHOL7a,24(S)DONE [endoplasmic reticulum membrane]"
