        "@value": "(S)-3-Hydroxytetradecanoyl-CoA [mitochondrial matrix] + NAD+ [mitochondrial matrix] => H+ [mitochondrial matrix] + NADH [mitochondrial matrix] + 3-Oxotetradecanoyl-CoA [mitochondrial matrix]"
