        "@value": "DHCE [endoplasmic reticulum membrane] + H+ [cytosol] + CYB5B:Fe2+ [endoplasmic reticulum membrane] + O2 [cytosol] => H2O [cytosol] + phytoceramide [endoplasmic reticulum membrane] + CYB5B:Fe3+ [endoplasmic reticulum membrane]"
